            "question": "Find the capacity in litres of a conical vessel with radius 7 cm and slant height 25 cm.",
            "finalAnswer": "1.232 Litres",
            "solutionSteps": [
                "$h = \\sqrt{25^2 - 7^2} = 24$.",
                "Volume = $(1/3) \\times (22/7) \\times 49 \\times 24 = 1232$ cm³.",
                "1232 cm³ = 1.232 litres."
            ]
